{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1302161","title":"PRJNA20250806","description":"Sludge samples were taken for Illumina sequencing at 7 and 30 d, respectively, and there was a difference in the MNZ concentrations taken for MD (0, 10, 100 mg/L) and TD (0, 50, 100 mg/L). DNA fragments of the communities were quantified using Nanodrop and then paired-end sequenced using Illumina. Primers 338F (ACTCCTACGGGAGGCAGCAG) and 806R (GGACTACHVGGGTWTCTAAT) targeting the V3-V4 regions (468 bp) of the bacterial 16S rRNA gene were used. Sequence denoising or OTU clustering was performed according to the Quantitative Insights Into Microbial Ecology 2 (QIIME2) dada2 analysis process.","center":"shandong university","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2025/08/06 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN50464232","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2024-06-08",2024,"CN","Shandong",1797929,"Qingdao","verified",null,null,"China:Qingdao","anaerobic sludge",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN50464233","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2024-06-09",2024,"CN","Shandong",1797929,"Qingdao","verified",null,null,"China:Qingdao","anaerobic sludge",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN50464234","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2024-06-10",2024,"CN","Shandong",1797929,"Qingdao","verified",null,null,"China:Qingdao","anaerobic sludge",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN50464235","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge meta